11. V.
                Dasselbe; 

                Fingersatz; Vortrag auf Unbedingtheit geprüft.

October 19
                Development section of the first movement of his sonata;
                correction of his work on Roth No. 1.

May 11
                The same; 

                fingering; performance measured against absoluteness.

October 31. Chopin Etude in A minor, Op. 25, No. 11, new;
                    graph of bars 1–16 corrected; hints about the following
                    measures.

November 14 Correction 

                of the Etude, in fair copy;
                a second fair copy requested. Correction of Brahms Waltz No. 5.

15. X. Programm:
                    Stimmführung, Urlinie, Klavier;
                sogleich etwas zur Urlinie.

October 15 Program:
                    voice-leading, Urlinie, piano;
                immediately something about the Urlinie.

17. X.
                Brahms-Händel Variationen;
                korrigiere nur bis zur Fuge.
